{
  "name": "伊格薇尔伏恶魔志 Demonomicon of Iggwilv",
  "type": "equipment",
  "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-open-purple.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"WordSection1\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">作为一份关于深渊之无限层级及其居民的宏大论文，</span><span class=\"GramE\"><em>伊格薇尔伏恶魔</em></span><em>志</em><span class=\"SpellE\"><em>Demonomicon</em></span><em> of </em><span class=\"SpellE\"><em>Iggwilv</em></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">是多元宇宙中最详细而最为亵渎的关于恶魔学识的记载。这卷书记载了从亘古到现在关于深渊与恶魔的所有</span><span class=\"GramE\">渎</span>神之物。恶魔们尝试过删减其中的文本，而虽有的部分被从书本<span class=\"GramE\">的脊页上</span>撕下，但大部分章节仍存，而且较之前更能揭示恶魔的秘密。这书所含之物已非亵渎二字所能形容。一小片不为人知的，无底深渊本身的碎片被囚禁于字字句句之后，使得无论有多少页被撕下，也能让<span class=\"GramE\">书时刻</span>保持着更新，这本书也不仅仅只是想要成为一本参考材料。<br><em><strong>随机属性</strong></em><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">。这件神器具有以下随机属性，你可以通过对着<em>《地下城主指南》</em>中的</span><span class=\"bbccolor\"><em>“神器”</em></span> <span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">章节掷</span><span class=\"GramE\">骰</span>以决定它们。</p><ul><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;tab-stops:list 36.0pt;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">两项弱效增益属性</span></li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;tab-stops:list 36.0pt;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">一项强效减益属性</span></li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;tab-stops:list 36.0pt;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">一项弱效减益属性</span></li></ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br><em><strong>法术。</strong></em><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">这本书具有</span>8<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">发充能，且每天黎明时恢复</span>1d8<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">发已消耗的充能。当你持握它时，你可以用一个动作随意施展<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.n9RjfSJ88RfFhO1T]{塔莎狂笑术Tasha’s Hideous Laughter}</em>或消耗</span>1<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">发或更多的充能施展以下法术（</span>DC20<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">）：<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.Vrzu8xpLMvOvOnx6]{防护法阵Magic Circle}</em>（</span>1<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">发充能），</span><span class=\"GramE\"><em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.SWopkvFFxAkCwG7W]{魔魂壶Magic Jar}</em></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">（</span>3<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">发充能），</span><span class=\"GramE\"><em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.XbVBvp0A6Nf7imnf]{异界盟誓Planar Ally}</em></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">（</span>3<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">发充能），</span><span class=\"GramE\"><em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.PmucSbzqmGhwisuE]{异界誓缚Planar Binding}</em></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">（</span>2<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">发充能），</span><span class=\"GramE\"><em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.VveuAHLNPiAY0yd5]{异界传送Plane Shift}</em></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">（仅限深渊层级；</span>3<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">发充能），<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.5wQNcY6579h2jLeA]{邪魔召唤术Summon Fiend}</em>（</span>3<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">发充能；出现于本书）。</span><br><em><strong>深渊学识。</strong></em><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">你可以在你每次进行辨认关于恶魔的消息的智力检定或关于深渊的感知（生存）检定时查阅恶魔志。若如此做，你的检定使用双倍的熟练加值。</span><br><em><strong>鞭笞邪魔。</strong></em><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">你的魔法会为邪魔带来痛苦。当你携带书，并为自己所施展的法术对一个邪魔进行伤害掷</span><span class=\"GramE\">骰</span>时，直接取满值而无须掷<span class=\"GramE\">骰</span>。<br><em><strong>迷惑。</strong></em><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">当你携带着书，每次你施展对邪魔的<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.Vrzu8xpLMvOvOnx6]{防护法阵Magic Circle}</em>或<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.PmucSbzqmGhwisuE]{异界誓缚Planar Binding}</em>时，无论你使用了哪个等级的法术位，都视为以</span>9<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">环施展。此外，邪魔在对抗这些法术的豁免检定上具有劣势。</span><br><em><strong>封印。</strong></em><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">恶魔志的前</span>10<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">页是空白的。持握这本书时，作为一个动作，你可以选择一个你可见且被困在<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.Vrzu8xpLMvOvOnx6]{防护法阵Magic Circle}</em>中的邪魔。该邪魔必须以劣势进行一次</span>DC20<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">的魅力豁免，豁免失败则被困在恶魔志的一张空白页中。并且会附上受困生物广为人知的名字与堕落内容的详细文字。使用后，直到下次黎明前，这项动作不能再次使用。</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">当你结束了</span><span class=\"GramE\">一</span>次长休时，如果你和恶魔<span class=\"GramE\">志存在</span>于同一位面，则书中所困挑战等级最高的生物可以尝试附身你。你必须进行一次DC20<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">的魅力豁免。若豁免失败，则你如同一具提线玩偶般被该生物附身。附身你的生物可以用一个动作释放你，并在最近的一处未占据空间出现。若豁免成功，则尝试附身你的邪魔在未来</span>7<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">天内都不能再次尝试附身你。</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">在</span><span class=\"GramE\">这本魔典被</span>发现时，已经有了[[/r 1d4]]<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">张书页被占据，一般是各种恶魔。</span><br><em><strong>破坏恶魔志。</strong></em><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">要摧毁这本书，必须有六位不同的恶魔领主分别撕下书的一页。如果这种情况发生，书页会在</span>24<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">小时内恢复。在这段时间过去之前，任何打开书的人都会被传送到一处隐藏在书中的新生深渊层级。在这致命、的半智能领域中心，有一件遗失许久的神器，弗拉兹</span>-<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">厄鲁之杖。如果法杖被带离这处口袋位面，</span><span class=\"GramE\">魔典会</span>立刻变成一本<em>《反序古典Tome of </em><span class=\"SpellE\"><em>Zyx</em></span><em>》</em><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">普通而老旧的复制品，这本书是创造恶魔志的基底。法杖一旦出现，恶魔领主弗拉兹</span>-<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">厄鲁会立刻知道这件事。</span></p></div>",
